{"id":4015,"date":"2025-05-30T03:45:17","date_gmt":"2025-05-30T03:45:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4015"},"modified":"2025-08-16T01:48:57","modified_gmt":"2025-08-16T01:48:57","slug":"cach-tao-tiktok-shop","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/cach-tao-tiktok-shop\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o TikTok Shop cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"M1iAdMa7jo7bPsxxtS4luh8Ygmh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rg1CdjEiqoVLVNxFAiBlDrBPglc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Shop n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok, cho ph\u00e9p mua s\u1eafm ngay trong video v\u00e0 livestream. Xem ngay b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o TikTok Shop l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng h\u1ec1 kh\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HFFUdD31HonvgQxzW80l2Af5gOf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">TikTok Shop l\u00e0 g\u00ec? T\u1ea1i sao nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng kinh doanh TikTok Shop?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LgucdtmPdoceZhxRR3elJHe0gLb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Shop l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng mua b\u00e1n t\u00edch h\u1ee3p tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c video ng\u1eafn v\u00e0 livestream sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm nhanh ch\u00f3ng, ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i ngay tr\u00ean m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i y\u00eau th\u00edch.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GwUndq8svoKuIxx9cxNlSmjLgDg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kinh doanh tr\u00ean TikTok Shop \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng v\u00ec l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng l\u1edbn, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 gi\u1edbi tr\u1ebb. Video ng\u1eafn gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m lan truy\u1ec1n nhanh, ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N2XCdnA2CoJKShxOBbPlwuhYgcW\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4019\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4019\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4019\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-2.png\" alt=\"TikTok Shop l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng mua b\u00e1n t\u00edch h\u1ee3p tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4019\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Shop l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng mua b\u00e1n t\u00edch h\u1ee3p tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-a