k.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-QQ7ndqnpso8EmmxYaz6lVXsCgad\" style=\"text-align: left;\" data-type=\"divider\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p (th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, shop):<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PxOvdRIZcoAVhOxz2IllhW25g7F\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u00e1p nh\u00e2n: C\u00f3 gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WakvdxefSokpiGxrINHl1WOxg83\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u00e3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf: \u0110\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd m\u00e3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y263dzBjVozu8jxYm5olASJqgDY\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd: CMND\/CCCD c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n ph\u00e1p lu\u1eadt.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DlC4dlUTTorwZexzToPli6WPgvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng: S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng thu\u1ed9c danh m\u1ee5c c\u1ea5m theo ph\u00e1p lu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDXCdKc0SoUijwxaK0LliS4ug3d\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd chung:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AWZDdAzFlo2bRZxNj2llBNWAgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: Ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p b\u00e1n c\u00e1c m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMrqdZd5zo4lDVxmOXxltt3Dgdg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng: C\u1ea7n c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YabUdVGvpolJ5Wxj71rlFBIJgLd\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4022\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4022\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4022\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-1.png\" alt=\"\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4022\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"M1iAdMa7jo7bPsxxtS4luh8Ygmh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SvjFdEBnhooqzMxBPEYl2ju1gQe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o TikTok Shop<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H1qGdlSk1oZ6N7xG6pqljfCogmg\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjOodMFp8oVRaZxRDKxlWMtzgvf\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp trang \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd TikTok Shop<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmPYdB1Qxo2zX1xMxVyltu9Igxb\">&#8211; V\u00e0o trang web ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c: <a href=\"https:\/\/seller-vn.tiktok.com\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/seller-vn.tiktok.com<\/a><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CGY2dRIfRoBMCIx1Di8lnqn8gBg\">&#8211; Ch\u1ecdn <strong>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd<\/strong> (Sign Up).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mcm3dgE9moKbzCxLWilltTHZg6c\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WnEfd80rioV3uaxVusDl29ewgxh\">&#8211; D\u00f9ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQt3d0XG0ozORzx26e6lJAhCg4g\">&#8211; N\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UfjddrKrtoovg9x3ZgwlSJ3VgMh\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Ch\u1ecdn lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh kinh doanh<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDlvdhlWUoCsbdxrvxClcyajgWf\">Ch\u1ecdn <strong>C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c <strong>Doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong> t\u00f9y theo b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n hay c\u00f4ng ty.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IxtPdZ8SyoQx4CxHAKqlywgLgdb\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: \u0110i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MJPHdlU7Lot2WYxX63jlwinngfc\">&#8211; V\u1edbi c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n: \u0111i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin t\u00ean, s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I6ykdIziioqGP5x7CEglcZ4zgpe\">&#8211; V\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p: \u0111i\u1ec1n t\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty, m\u00e3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf, gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Irg6dxPdzohzlLxL25oluTC1gic\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PWtYdClKIoSSQAxIfdzlnOE4gKb\">&#8211; T\u1ea3i l\u00ean h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh CMND\/CCCD\/h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu (v\u1edbi c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W8wJdpb0AodIVixAaoOlt0CLgEf\">&#8211; Ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh v\u00e0 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n ph\u00e1p l\u00fd (v\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OdHrd9Q7ZoRpCIx6XrTlDLYDghb\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gian h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WjiMdAMveoL5LCxJfDBlTwBhgPf\">&#8211; \u0110i\u1ec1n t\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Enu8dDW9jouXV9xRVlAltyQJgVb\">&#8211; Th\u00eam m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 gian h\u00e0ng, logo (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Il1AdGNzfoMAvxxxiVklBcJ5gKh\">&#8211; K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Aut2dQLR1o5VGxxaJUtlDFebgJb\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 7: \u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1aGdxvvwoDiP3xcXbQlzqxPgph\">&#8211; Th\u00eam s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft: t\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, gi\u00e1, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W09qdxA5Fo3VMMxcm3bl4WrPgih\">&#8211; Ch\u1ecdn danh m\u1ee5c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XprwdfusUooYsdxRfh5llMbPgzf\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 8: B\u1ea