lockId&quot;:&quot;52b0a198-6f45-4660-87d5-0deb62e7ca30&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;FILE_CARD_BLOCK&quot;,&quot;props&quot;:{&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;fileId&quot;:&quot;6n1gOs1vRlwv-12&quot;,&quot;fileInfo&quot;:{&quot;driveKey&quot;:&quot;MLbFbOV91ovpjcx4QCIl2jipgLf&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TikTok Shop VN - Phi\u0301 Sua\u0302\u0301t Phi\u0301 Hoa Ho\u0302\u0300ng Ne\u0302\u0300n Ta\u0309ng.pdf&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:440833,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;pdf&quot;,&quot;useDriveStorage&quot;:true,&quot;actualType&quot;:&quot;application\/pdf&quot;,&quot;uploadOwner&quot;:&quot;7503379931792162847&quot;}},&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;fromCopy&quot;:true,&quot;viewType&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;}}\" data-inline-type=\"file\"><span class=\"block-paste-placeholder\"><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/TikTok-Shop-VN-Phi-Suat-Phi-Hoa-Hong-Nen-Tang.pdf\">TikTok Shop VN &#8211; Phi\u0301 Sua\u0302\u0301t Phi\u0301 Hoa Ho\u0302\u0300ng Ne\u0302\u0300n Ta\u0309ng<\/a><br \/>\n<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GjhDdf7QfoPr2UxtQjIl1XRRg7e\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O36sdBKvfo1HhXxBMkiljp27gtd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QDn8dFx5yoWvlDxpU8Ol9NZogsb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ph\u1ea3i ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i y\u00eau c\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng\/ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n trong v\u00f2ng <strong>1 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c<\/strong> k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 Nh\u00e0 B\u00e1n H\u00e0ng Mall tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i cung c\u1ea5p cho Kh\u00e1ch H\u00e0ng th\u1eddi gian h\u1eadu m\u00e3i l\u00e0 15 <strong>ng\u00e0y cho c\u00e1c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng <\/strong>\u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng tr\u00eanTikTok Shop Mall.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BopZdeosNoi8wKxXWlnlTA8Ygmh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngu\u1ed3n: <a href=\"https:\/\/seller-vn.tiktok.com\/university\/essay?default_language=en&amp;knowledge_id=6837773789234946\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TikTok Shop University<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6CfdpOOootU51xxZEtljsfMgLf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch &#8220;Ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng&#8221; (Refund Without Return):<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4F2dZbGsoumiuxTUa6lfscSgEe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb <strong>8\/1\/2025<\/strong> t\u1ea1i \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1, bao g\u1ed3m Vi\u1ec7t Nam.Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng trong c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XzCWdPad8oVv7ax807ElZ7gVgZf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RU7ndrbwnodMjjxKn8flmnkcgSf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 l\u1ed7i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MjS1d2jQ6oNNQExTPsblN3OUgif\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang m\u00f4 t\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jv0xddYqFofiwNxgtX1laGVKgPb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua \u0111\u1ed5i \u00fd (n\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n cho ph\u00e9p).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ses8drFo8o1msuxgN1rlqui1gM8\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Fulfilled by TikTok (FBT):<\/div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TU7udgZpPolcDNx0siFlkqlJgmg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng <strong>48 gi\u1edd<\/strong> sau ng\u00e0y giao h\u00e0ng d\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn, h\u1ecd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G7CsdHTvFoY0mhxtSF0lmR2tgKf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>TikTok s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UzSKdNhRhouUnuxZscNlROIAgac\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n l\u1ea1i s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng trong v\u00f2ng <strong>2 \u0111\u1ebfn 7 ng\u00e0y<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEVpd7J1BoNt9dxjeOglEW8qgle\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n do giao h\u00e0ng ch\u1eadm:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OYf8dPCRtoKXYXxShiUl3gMMgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1eeb <strong>14\/2\/2025<\/strong>, TikTok Shop s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao trong v\u00f2ng <strong>4 ng\u00e0y<\/strong> sau ng\u00e0y giao h\u00e0ng d\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dncqdr6jao9xIix1Dsvl6ILUgod\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng FBT ho\u1eb7c Shipped by TikTok: N\u1ebfu h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao cho \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n, TikTok s\u1ebd ch\u1ecbu chi ph\u00ed ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiTdqPJgoeu3VxVrHvl2ySQgCb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Shipped by Seller: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n s\u1ebd ch\u1ecbu chi ph\u00ed ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4024\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4024\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4024\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-14-1.png\" alt=\"Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok v\u00e0 TikTok Shop\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-14-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-14-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-14-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-14-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-14-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4024\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok v\u00e0 TikTok Shop<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"M1iAdMa7jo7bPsxxtS4luh8Ygmh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-G7PFdQA1JoaIiXxWYxrlpQe5glf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Tiktok Shop \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb t\u1ee5t \u0111\u01a1n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CptRdOBGLo1cjzxRgtalQR7ugpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 <strong>c\u00e1c l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 <strong>tr\u00e1nh t\u1ee5t \u0111\u01a1n<\/strong> v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kinh doanh \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZ9ldA6L9o1C0yxUR8TlHGYagyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trong 24\u201372h.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HFuTdJ8bQoFtUAx7mmVlG4HXgrg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u1ed3n kho th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean, tr\u00e1nh h\u1ebft h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TmbDdZyD9osMYCxbipTlIX71gPf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u0103ng video ng\u1eafn v\u00e0 livestream \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AaUcd7bNPoWuaAx71Rfl7SpSgkb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn\/tin nh\u1eafn nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LTJ4df3cXoRW0MxXFW3lIJpVgLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3, h\u00e0ng c\u1ea5m, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 \u0111\u00fang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SNEIdZTC5o85oEx6F8Xl1IgagOh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Theo d\u00f5i ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh (giao tr\u1ec5, h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 sao).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Od4rdvLXOoqxQhxkO4SlBUM3gxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tham gia c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VeHVdbMmCo8lRAxQs8XlnXawgog\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1eafm r\u00f5 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng\/ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-ZNgLdQqq3o3diaxwIcwlmDu8gah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;13163bed-8efa-47e7-a04e-fe43d9a8d597&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJPTDbq19towaa0xEOJ5lvA8sgBh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JPTDbq19towaa0xEOJ5lvA8sgBh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCXNd6aJxoTj6Ox85lTlSXJGgue\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LoETditHBojiaCxfgZ8lBNy3gOe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXF0dDGh6oWJEMx7N52l2QGPgKc\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WYDydhKAGoMlu3x0c0ClS4avgzb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wzv1dX67voGnPExDOjQlzzF4gBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V1qxdta5IougLpxD3V